---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { formatDate } from '../utils';

const UPDATED = new Date('2026-07-31');
---

<Base title="Now" description="What Sanskar is working on right now.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article style="max-width: 46rem;">
      <section class="hero" style="padding-block: 3.5rem 1rem;">
        <p class="label hero__eyebrow rise rise-1">/now</p>
        <h1 class="rise rise-2">Right now</h1>
      </section>

      <div class="prose rise rise-3" style="max-width: 42rem;">
        <p class="muted mono" style="font-size:0.78rem;">Last updated {formatDate(UPDATED)}</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Mostly heads-down on storage engines and distributed systems in Go.</li>
          <li>
            Two open-source projects I keep going back to:
            <a href="https://github.com/sanskarpan/promptline">PromptLine</a> (LLM evals)
            and <a href="https://github.com/sanskarpan/tag-agent">TAG</a>, an agent runtime
            I recently ported to Go.
          </li>
          <li>Trying to write more here, and take my time with it.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.85rem;">
          This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">/now page</a>. A snapshot, not a résumé.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
